NC Digital builds affordable, professional websites for small businesses — without cutting corners on quality. You get a custom-built site that looks the part, loads fast, and works hard for your business.

> "You shouldn't have to choose between affordable and professional. We built NC Digital to prove you can have both."

## What does an affordable small business website include?

Every project includes everything you need to get online and start generating enquiries:

- Custom website designed for your business
- Mobile-first, fully responsive layout
- On-page SEO as standard
- Fast UK-based hosting with SSL
- Full content management access
- Google Analytics setup
- Training on how to manage your site

## Why affordable doesn't mean cheap

We keep costs low by working directly with clients — no account managers, no agency layers, no unnecessary meetings. That means more of your budget goes into the website itself.

Think about it this way: if your website generates one extra customer a month — a single roofing job, a new regular client, one product sale — it's already covered its costs and then some. A website isn't an expense. It's the one member of your team that works around the clock, never calls in sick, and keeps bringing in new business long after it's paid for itself.

## Our most affordable option — Managed Starter Websites

For small businesses that want a professional online presence without a large upfront cost, our [Managed Starter Website](/services/managed-starter-websites/) is the most affordable route. From £20/month inc. VAT you get a fully managed website with domain, hosting, and ongoing management all included — no big one-off bill, no technical headaches.

It's ideal for sole traders and small businesses that want to get online quickly and keep costs predictable.

## How much does a small business website cost?

Every project is different. [Get a free website plan](/free-website-plan/) and we'll give you an exact quote with no obligation.

